Maintainer: Philipp Kern <pkern@debian.org>
Standards-Version: 3.9.7
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13), libncurses-dev, libssl-dev, libxaw7-dev, libxt-dev, xbitmaps, xfonts-utils, xutils-dev, tcl, tcl-dev, libexpat1-dev, imagemagick, python3, python3-requests, python3-psutil, net-tools, openssl
